---
import SiteLayout from '@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="关于作者" description="关于 Tursom 和 Tursom Log。">
  <div class="breadcrumbs">
    <a href="/">~/log</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><strong>about</strong>
  </div>
  <section class="page-intro compact-intro">
    <span class="eyebrow">ABOUT</span>
    <h1>关于 Tursom</h1>
    <p>关于软件、系统与长期实践的技术记录。</p>
  </section>
  <div class="about-content">
    <p>
      我是 Tursom，一名持续构建、拆解和记录软件系统的开发者。Tursom Log
      用来保存经过实践验证的技术笔记。
    </p>
    <p>这里的文章以问题、证据和实现过程为主，欢迎通过 GitHub Issue 提交勘误或建议。</p>
    <div class="about-links">
      <a class="button-link" href="https://github.com/tursom" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"
        >GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
      >
      <a
        class="button-link secondary"
        href="https://github.com/tursom/turblog/issues"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer">提交 Issue <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
